{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_st02",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_st02",
  "title": "苏醒的城市",
  "storyCode": "AS-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "469f1794eb102bc0ed96a892bf05f0a581421ee14cd5babfbdeebc181e67e355",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看起来祖拜尔似乎是打破了窗子......自己离开了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会去找他回来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交给博物馆去找吧，佩佩，你已经很多天都没好好休息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "黄金之城的使者很快就会抵达父亲的领地，阿娜特，我必须抓紧每一秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博物馆的损坏辛苦你和缇缇收拾了，或许有几个地方祖拜尔会去，我这就出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，你知道我为何一开始不愿将祖拜尔借给你研究吗？其实收到你的来信后，我就想告诉你了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在两个月前，我去你父亲的领地出差，在那里我见到黄金之城的使者已经抵达。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的弟弟已经出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道，但你却没有告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在信中兴高采烈地向我描述你的发现，在里面连写了二十个感叹号来表达自己的兴奋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我实在是不忍心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你为什么又要把他借给我，你让我白高兴一场......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是宝石之城，佩佩！这里的宝石数不胜数，我以为你根本没可能找到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想着，或许时间一到你自己就放弃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可......可黄金之城的使者一向都是八月份才会到的啊？为什么会提前？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你父亲上书，希望使者提前到来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以他们早就做好了决定，只是怕我不罢休，才趁我离开家寻找沙阿遗迹的时候，将那小子送入黄金之城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可父亲不是和我说......他会等着看到我的发现再做决断吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，长辈总是有自己的决断，不是我们这些小辈能插手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你见到那小子了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他一定很得意吧，为了进入黄金之城，我与他不知道明里暗里较过多少回劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，你弟弟并不开心，我看得出，他的神色中始终隐藏着忧伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那天，他将我叫到书房，说自己知道这辈子和你再也不会有见面的机会，希望我能带句话给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他说他希望你能记得他的声音。说完后，他便离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他行李很少，而其中只有几样是他的，剩下的，全部与你和伯父有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从小到大，所有人都和我说，成为陛下身边的史官是为整个家族延续荣耀。但是阿娜特，荣耀往往是用牺牲与奉献换来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "进入黄金之城成为史官，意味着要终身留在城中，再也不能与家人朋友相见，能够陪伴在身边的，只有无数的书卷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你最厌恶成日枯坐在书桌前了......不是吗，佩佩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，我也想在有生之年走遍萨尔贡，自由自在地寻访每一处历史留下的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我不能这样......因为我不能让那小子得偿所愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，你就这么看不惯你弟弟吗？宁可自己难受也不能让他顺遂心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从小到大，谁见到那小子都会夸一句，说他性格文静又沉稳，是做史官的料子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有我才清楚，他本性有多调皮多贪玩，让他在桌子前多坐一秒都是折磨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那他和你争史官的位置是为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为他不想我去黄金之城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他只是不想我一个人留在那里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不想他一个人留在那里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "缓解站立过久导致的腿酸的宝石？不是这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "让对方主动道歉的宝石？有点用，但也不是我要找的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能感觉到那一颗宝石十分接近，但这间屋子里的宝石也太多了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "听到走廊中传来的脚步声，祖拜尔立刻慌忙地躺回到巨大的镀金箱子里。\n他感觉到了目光的注视，然而没有声音打破这一阵沉默，他忐忑地将眼睛睁开一条缝——\n是一只沙色的动物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噢......不可思议......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沙色的动物跳进了镀金箱子里，脸贴着祖拜尔的金面具，似乎在轻嗅着其中散发的气味。\n黑色的动物也把头探进来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米奥......沃奥......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来，你的记忆已经恢复得差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，味道不会错，你不是赝品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "闭嘴吧沃奥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们怎么变得这么小了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们变成现在的样子，还不是因为你没有尽到仆从的职责？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "仆从的职责......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我在你们的眼里还是过去的样貌，那我就得天天被抬出去游行，哪有时间帮你找宝石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "相比之下，还是现在的形态更方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米奥，现在的祖拜尔还无法理解我们在讨论的内容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在他到来之前，我已经告诫过你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（愤怒地瞪视）哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（心虚地回避）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系，祖拜尔马上就会明白，这三百年来我们都经历了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奥",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沃奥，去把我们的新仆从叫来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的监管人穿过长长的走廊，走到祖拜尔的面前。\n蓝色的羽兽倏然飞起，飞向交易所墙壁的高处，拨动镶嵌其上的机关。\n齿轮啮合，发条咔咔作响，羽兽从开启的保险柜中取出了一颗宝石。\n羽兽将宝石放在托盘上的深褐色绒布中央，由年轻的监管人呈上。\n他的目光平和，他的目光炽热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖拜尔先生，初次见面......不，好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这颗宝石是我的砝码。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "附加上这间宝石交易所，还有在大巴扎流通的所有宝石......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖拜尔先生，我想知道这些全部加起来，能否比一个罪人的灵魂更沉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "门没锁，请进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请进？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你吗，娜仁图亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "门外的夜色中空无一人，但“笃笃”的敲门声还在继续。\n阿斯帕齐娅转过头，看到一个造型极为古典的机械装置正攀附在门上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "转动的构装体匀速敲打着门扉上镶嵌的宝石，不知从何而来的沙砾簌簌抖落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行窃者的新花样......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅伸手想将它摘下来的同时，它抱着宝石门饰掉到了地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宝石在黑暗中闪烁了一下光芒。然后，阿斯帕齐娅看着宝石和机械装置一起消失在了下水道的入口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
