    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以前都不知道一具古尸这么值钱，要不明天我们再去博物馆仓库里看看，还有没有别的死人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，就只找博物馆里的死人？你怎么就不懂得举一反三？"
