    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅吉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？没有，我肯定什么都没少，大盗怎么可能被别的人偷走东西。"
